nsxiv is the image viewer.

Navigation:
	h/j/k/l - Pan image
	-/+ - Zoom out/in
	n/p - Previous/next image in list/directory
	Enter - Toggle thumbnail mode
	r - Reload image if changed

View:
	w - Zoom to fit window
	f - Toggle fullscreen
	m - Mark/unmark images

External commands (ctrl-x then):
	w - Set as wallpaper
	c - Copy file to directory
	m - Move file to directory
	r/R - Rotate 90° clockwise/counter-clockwise
	f - Flip horizontally
	y/Y - Copy filename/full path to clipboard
	d - Delete file
	g - Open in GIMP
